Rule 3 (tensor shape dimensions should be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (tensor with specified dimensions must have valid shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= ndim(v_1) = v_2 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, v_2 - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 8 (tensor dimensions should be consistent with the input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = v_2 ∧ shape(v_1, v_2 - 1) = shape(v_3, 0)
